    {
      "duration_ms": 8000,
      "caption": "pingBinder is a poll; linkToDeath is a push, and only works for remote proxies.",
      "narration": "Remember that pingBinder polls, while linkToDeath pushes. And it only makes sense for a remote proxy, not a local object.",
